+[[qt.workarounds.locale]]
+=== qt.workarounds.locale
+Work around missing locale files with QtWebEngine 5.15.3 on Linux.
+When the system locale has no QtWebEngine resource file, use a suitable Chromium locale instead. This prevents network service crashes and blank pages.
+
+This setting requires a restart.
+
+Type: <<types,Bool>>
+
+Default: +pass:[false]+
+
+This setting is only available with the QtWebEngine backend.
+
 [[qt.workarounds.remove_service_workers]]
